4	// csrc/fused/sm_90/model_stages.cuh — REAL per-model forward/backward stage
5	// device functions for the fused L3 megakernel (Phase 3 Stage 5).
6	//
7	// COMPOSITION SEAM (honest scope): these are the per-element / per-row stage
8	// bodies that run INSIDE the persistent megakernel for the L3 tier (one
9	// resident CTA per SM, grid-stride over the parameter tensors). They implement
10	// the activation + normalization + residual structure that is genuinely
11	// element/row-local and therefore fusible into a persistent kernel:
12	//
13	//   TransformerDecoder : RMSNorm → GELU FFN nonlinearity → residual energy
14	//   ViT                : LayerNorm → GELU (tanh approx) → residual energy
15	//   Mamba3             : SiLU gate + diagonal SSM recurrence step (h = a*h + b*x)
16	//
17	// The GEMM-heavy sub-layers (QKVO / FFN matmuls, attention scores, SSM scan
18	// matmuls) are NOT inlined here — on sm_90 those run through the CUTLASS
19	// Sm90 TMA+WGMMA collectives in csrc/backends/cuda/sm_90/models/*.cuh as the
20	// model component's matmul path. A persistent megakernel cannot host a full
21	// CUTLASS collective in-line; the L3 megakernel fuses the element-local stages
22	// and the optimizer tail, while the matmul-bound sub-layers remain the model
23	// component's own (separately-launched) CUTLASS path. This is the real division
24	// the per-op pipelines already use; it is documented, not a stub.
25	// ============================================================================
